{"action": "next_grill_recommended", "at": "2026-08-28T21:50:37+00:00", "data": {"alternatives": ["Persist Commerce managed-stock setup transitions with an explicit idempotent command after Inventory exposes the registration operation.", "Design the EmDash Configure Inventory setup UI around the now-typed setup-required, needs-review, and active states without adding live transport yet."], "reason": "Commerce now has a verified provider-neutral handshake, but a live cross-stack proof cannot exist until Inventory can atomically create or return the pool-wide SKU identity. That operation is the narrowest dependency and can be built without deciding OAuth or EmDash plugin transport.", "recommended": "Implement Inventory-owned atomic register-or-return for one pool-wide canonical SKU, minting the permanent inventorySkuId and preserving the first displayNameIfNew without creating balances or receipts.", "recorded_at": "2026-08-28T21:50:36+00:00"}, "event_id": "6ba4e1b6-ef5e-483b-bea0-95d1d05c8290"}
